      "avoid_for": "室内特写、需要干净纯色背景的用途",
      "fidelity": "medium",
      "fidelity_reason": "光影是这类风格的主角，构图需守住但颜色与影调要放开，medium 平衡二者。",
      "negative_extra": ["flat cel shading", "harsh flash photography", "dull overcast light"]
    },
